      "channels": "independent",
      "algorithm": "For each channel and frame n, edge-extend x[n-1] and x[n+1], then output round_ties_even((x[n-1] + 6*x[n] + x[n+1]) / 8) saturated to signed-16. The symmetric FIR has unity DC gain and 0.5 Nyquist gain.",
