      "family": "stereo_width",
      "channels": "stereo_only",
      "algorithm": "For each stereo frame (L,R), output L'=round_ties_even((3*L+R)/4) and R'=round_ties_even((L+3*R)/4), each saturated to signed-16. This preserves the mid signal and scales the side signal by 0.5.",
